{
  "bodyHash": "HNeWxVGHuAo=",
  "content": "<h5>本模组是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力</a> 的扩展，新增了由多种材料制成的飞轮变体，可将其喷涂成任意颜色，并且这些飞轮在火车上也能旋转。</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Fabric 版本可在此处找到：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-extended-flywheels-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击前往</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>机械动力 0.5.c 至 0.5.f（支持 1.18.2 和 1.19.2）均完全兼容本模组。未特别标注的文件适用于 0.5.d，标记为 0.5.c 和 0.5.e 的版本已作说明——若寻找正确版本时遇到困惑，请查阅更新日志。</strong></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p>自 v1.2 版本起，更新任何模组前请务必备份您的世界，以防万一。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>更多列车装饰请查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daves-building-extended\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dave's Building Extended</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-powderlogy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Powderlogy &amp; Illumination</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>材料</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbitminers/Extended-Flywheels/master/iron_flywheel_showcase.png\" alt=\"铁质飞轮\" width=\"1037\" height=\"362\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">铁质飞轮的合成方式与机械动力原版飞轮相同。它们的外观可模仿机械动力的列车转向架，但颜色更多样，尺寸也更庞大。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbitminers/Extended-Flywheels/master/steel_flywheel_showcase.png\" alt=\"钢质飞轮\" width=\"1037\" height=\"362\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">不必担心，本模组并未添加新的“钢锭”，也不依赖任何添加钢材的模组。为了尽可能兼容现有世界，铁质飞轮可通过高炉熔炼转化为钢质飞轮；若您的整合包中存在钢材，也可像其他飞轮一样直接用钢锭合成。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbitminers/Extended-Flywheels/master/brass_flywheel_showcase.png\" alt=\"黄铜飞轮\" width=\"1037\" height=\"362\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>黄铜飞轮可直接用机械动力的原版飞轮一比一兑换，或按独立配方合成。（请注意：机械动力原版飞轮<strong>不会</strong>在火车上旋转，请改用本模组的黄铜飞轮。）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>1.2 版本新增内容</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbitminers/Extended-Flywheels/master/fully_wooden_showcase.png\" alt=\"全木质飞轮\" width=\"1037\" height=\"362\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbitminers/Extended-Flywheels/master/mostly_wooden_showcase.png\" alt=\"半木质飞轮\" width=\"1037\" height=\"362\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>示例</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbitminers/Extended-Flywheels/master/rocket_example_direction_fixed.png\" alt=\"使用本模组建造的史蒂芬森火箭机车\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Rabbitminers/Extended-Flywheels/master/red_train_example.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>本地化</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果您愿意，任何翻译协助都将备受感激。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">注意：部分词语可能略有改动，或某些方块名称缺失，请向我反馈以便修复 :)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>- en_us&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;美式英语&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>- en_uk&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;英式英语</p><p>- de_de&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;德语&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Knalli65hd&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>- no_no&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;挪威语（书面）&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Svien&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>- pl_pl&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;波兰语&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Stacode</p><p>- nl_nl&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;荷兰语&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Coolensnor</p><p>- ru_ru&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;俄语&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; TPEcool</p><p>- cs_cz&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 捷克语&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;official_deadovnik&nbsp;</p><p>- sk_sk&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 斯洛伐克语&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;official_deadovnik</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若遇到问题或发现任何漏洞，欢迎在 Discord 上联系我（<strong>Rabbitminers#0086</strong>），或在 GitHub 提交反馈：<a href=\"https://github.com/Rabbitminers/Extended-Flywheels/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Rabbitminers/Extended-Flywheels/issues</a></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
